": "Example: The highway is the fastest way to get to the airport."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "traffic jam"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when there are too many cars on the road and they can't move"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Look at this traffic jam. We're going to be late!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "road"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a flat surface that cars and other vehicles drive on"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Take this road to get to the airport."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "almost"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "just a small amount less than"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are we almost there yet?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "expressway"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a wide road for high speed traffic"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can take the expressway and be there in an hour."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le05ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le05ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a map of your favorite city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find the airport. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write directions on how to get to the airport from another location. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your directions aloud to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's directions."}]}, {